{
    "title": "Super Matino - Adventure Game",
    "description": "<b>Super Matino - Adventure Game</b>, a new thrilling addition to the platforming world of old-school action games, promises to take you on an exciting journey as you navigate through challenging levels and uncover hidden secrets in this epic arcade experience with our hero Matino!\r\n\r\n<b>Matino Runner</b> will take you back to your childhood with the legendary mission: Princess Rescue. Your task is to help Supper Matino fight evil monsters through meltdown islands to save his darling Princess at the Darkness castle.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc8e <b>HOW TO PLAY SUPER MATINO - ADVENTURE GAME</b> \ud83d\udc78\ud83d\udc78\ud83d\udc78\r\n1. Tap the buttons to control Matino, fire bullets, and avoid obstacles.\r\n2. Consume the Big Potion to destroy geometry bricks more easily.\r\n3. Jump on the monsters' heads to smash them.\r\n4. Collect coins to buy booster items and bullets.\r\n5. Complete the level before time runs out.\r\n6. Try your best to collect all 3 stars at each level.\r\n7. Reach the end of every 10 levels to face the big boss.\r\n8. Defeat the final boss and save his Princess!\r\n\r\n<b>ENGAGING FEATURES:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udf44 100% Free.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 No Wi-fi or Internet required.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 Suitable for all ages.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 Simple illustration with the tutorial.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 Eye-catching design, great music and sounds.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 Lucky spins, daily gifts, achievement board.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 An exclusive collection of unique skins.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 3 worlds, 20+ maps, many mysterious locations.\r\n\ud83c\udf44 200+ well-designed levels, more are coming soon!\r\n\r\n<b>Matino's World</b> is a classic adventure running world game with fantastic playing style. With its levels' difficulty streamlined from easy to hard, this super Matino - adventure game will:\r\n\ud83d\udc24 Help newbies join the fun run quickly.\r\n\ud83c\udf0b Bring greater challenges to experienced players.\r\n\u23f3 Take advantage of your free time effectively.\r\n\ud83e\udd73 Relieve stress after hours of work and study.\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Offer endless entertainment anywhere and anytime!\r\n\r\nIf you are a big fan of action movies and games, you will quickly love this super adventure jungle game! Download <b>Super Matino - Adventure Game</b> to join Martino on his greatest journey now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Super Matino - Adventure Game</b>, a new thrilling addition to the platforming world of old-school action games, promises to take you on an exciting journey as you navigate through challenging levels and uncover hidden secrets in this epic arcade experience with our hero Matino!<br><br><b>Matino Runner</b> will take you back to your childhood with the legendary mission: Princess Rescue. Your task is to help Supper Matino fight evil monsters through meltdown islands to save his darling Princess at the Darkness castle.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc8e\ud83d\udc8e <b>HOW TO PLAY SUPER MATINO - ADVENTURE GAME</b> \ud83d\udc78\ud83d\udc78\ud83d\udc78<br>1. Tap the buttons to control Matino, fire bullets, and avoid obstacles.<br>2. Consume the Big Potion to destroy geometry bricks more easily.<br>3. Jump on the monsters&#39; heads to smash them.<br>4. Collect coins to buy booster items and bullets.<br>5. Complete the level before time runs out.<br>6. Try your best to collect all 3 stars at each level.<br>7. Reach the end of every 10 levels to face the big boss.<br>8. Defeat the final boss and save his Princess!<br><br><b>ENGAGING FEATURES:</b><br>\ud83c\udf44 100% Free.<br>\ud83c\udf44 No Wi-fi or Internet required.<br>\ud83c\udf44 Suitable for all ages.<br>\ud83c\udf44 Simple illustration with the tutorial.<br>\ud83c\udf44 Eye-catching design, great music and sounds.<br>\ud83c\udf44 Lucky spins, daily gifts, achievement board.<br>\ud83c\udf44 An exclusive collection of unique skins.<br>\ud83c\udf44 3 worlds, 20+ maps, many mysterious locations.<br>\ud83c\udf44 200+ well-designed levels, more are coming soon!<br><br><b>Matino&#39;s World</b> is a classic adventure running world game with fantastic playing style. With its levels&#39; difficulty streamlined from easy to hard, this super Matino - adventure game will:<br>\ud83d\udc24 Help newbies join the fun run quickly.<br>\ud83c\udf0b Bring greater challenges to experienced players.<br>\u23f3 Take advantage of your free time effectively.<br>\ud83e\udd73 Relieve stress after hours of work and study.<br>\ud83c\udf89 Offer endless entertainment anywhere and anytime!<br><br>If you are a big fan of action movies and games, you will quickly love this super adventure jungle game! Download <b>Super Matino - Adventure Game</b> to join Martino on his greatest journey now!",
